Reverse a String

Exercise:
Reverse a string without using .reverse().

Example:

Input:  "hello"

Output: "olleh"


Solution:

1. With Buildin methods

let str = "Hello";
let arr = str.split("");
let revArr = arr.reverse();
let newStr = revArr.join("");

console.log(newStr);


2. With loops

let str = "Hello";
let newStr = "";

for (let i = str.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
  newStr += str[i];
}

console.log(newStr);
